{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4849590","formula":"C₁₈H₂₄O","hill":"C18H24O","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":24.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Bakuchiol","ru":"Бакучиол","uk":"Бакучіол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Bakuchiol is a meroterpenoid (a chemical compound having a partial terpenoid structure) in the class terpenophenol. It was first isolated in 1966 by Mehta et al. from Psoralea corylifolia seed and was called Bakuchiol based on the Sanskrit name of the plant, Bakuchi.","uk":"Бакучіол — це меротерпен класу терпенофенолів. Його знайдено в різних видах рослин триби Psoraleeae, зокрема у рослинах видів Psoralea corylifolia та Psoralea drupaceae. Бакучіолу притаманна висока і різнобічна біологічна активність, зокрема антимікробна та протигрибкова."},"fame":14,"pubchemCid":5468522,"mass":256.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(=CCC[C@@](C)(C=C)/C=C/C1=CC=C(C=C1)O)C","inchikey":"LFYJSSARVMHQJB-QIXNEVBVSA-N","iupac":"4-[(1E,3S)-3-ethenyl-3,7-dimethylocta-1,6-dienyl]phenol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5468522","atoms":43,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":5.751,"y":-1.66,"z":0.54,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.389,"y":1.854,"z":-0.082,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.539,"y":0.801,"z":0.023,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.506,"y":-0.325,"z":-1.023,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.463,"y":2.548,"z":-1.462,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.061,"y":1.141,"z":0.178,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.519,"y":2.973,"z":0.956,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.694,"y":-1.235,"z":-0.87,"el":"C"},{"x":0.975,"y":1.015,"z":-0.668,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.81,"y":-2.303,"z":-0.057,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.473,"y":3.14,"z":1.88,"el":"C"},{"x":2.23,"y":0.312,"z":-0.35,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.029,"y":-3.175,"z":0.05,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.677,"y":-2.699,"z":0.851,"el":"C"},{"x":2.25,"y":-0.607,"z":0.687,"el":"C"},{"x":3.367,"y":0.583,"z":-1.094,"el":"C"},{"x":3.439,"y":-1.272,"z":0.988,"el":"C